        "value": "支配地高 一 十一万八千十八石八斗三合／しはいちだか 118,018.803こく"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Kokudaka of territory under direct administration: 118,018.803 koku. MASTER reads 拾壹萬八千百八拾石 (118,180.803); the disputed glyph zoomed at 8x is a plain cross 十 with no top slant and no 日 box, and 118,018.803 + 31,981.2 + 5,000 gives exactly the printed 〆 subtotal of 155,000.003, so the scan wins."
