      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Storehouse rice attached to the Kiku county intendancy: 31,981.2 koku. MASTER conflates this line with the next as '内 企救郡代御賞典米 壹萬貳千石 (12,000)', a value that appears nowhere on the page; the page prints two separate items, and only those two make the 〆 subtotal come out. The facing leaf (book page 81) independently prints 但御藏米高 三萬千九百八十一石貳斗, the same figure."
      },
