        "value": "Lord's storehouse rice: 36,981.2 koku, with the label printed after the figure. It is the second item of the 内 breakdown of the 212,598.552 koku total: 212,598.552 − 10,000 (Chizuka) − 36,981.2 leaves 165,617.352, which is exactly the 残 拾六萬五千六百拾七石三斗五升貳合 printed at the head of the facing leaf (book page 81). It exceeds the 企救郡代御藏米 line by exactly 5,000 koku, which is the discrepancy flagged in the compiler's marginal note."
      },
