  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_right-21",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "御藏米本文ト差引ト照會スレハ五千石ノ違ヒ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "御蔵米、本文と差引とを照会すれば五千石の違い／おくらまい、ほんぶんとさしひきとをしょうかいすれば ごせんごくのちがい"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Compiler's note set in four narrow columns in the top-left margin, with emphasis dots beside 五・千・石: 'Checking the storehouse rice in the main text against the figure derived by subtraction, there is a difference of 5,000 koku.' Verified: the main text is the facing leaf's 但御藏米高 三萬千九百八十一石貳斗 (31,981.2), the subtraction figure is this leaf's 三萬六千九百八十壹石貳斗 (36,981.2), and the gap is exactly the 御賞典米 award of 5,000 koku."
      },
